{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_028_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:99c10cdf67cf13ac36961cc60d1dfc805c8d0665a03821d4aee3ad8375500642",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b6a4a0c98d2d6ef95b3a3c07d1d46753b72d982f0bb6ec61cd910f777500459d",
      "text": "哎呀？\n这是……情人节的巧克力吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2b28ac112e9819a5894ca6a8b4a26277ef991c579e5d62469a8c1ce0e9e4678",
      "text": "我对甜点可是很挑剔的哦？\n……开个玩笑。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_a:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:879287509acb79d83eda5fd6500f04e018812d07326468bd1b153f366786877a",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー的这番心意，\n我心怀感激地收下了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca1ce14458da0d23604967dc22ada56ecfeae6a8abbe18c79f0b3e63b0518ead",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该去上训练课了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5ed0f58a10d9ad13be1f55292bee87d806dda0be143b2c4102cc9b5d03facce",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，等休息的时候\n我会细细品尝的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0311a8a9942d34c5e8b5a23e4e5025aed8fd3f6b6126aef95d1df1acefff181e",
      "text": "这是情人节巧克力……\n制作人，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea75aec7d7b1af0e433a41d9be8c8d921924150efb651c3d8c80fc1da23f6364",
      "text": "……哎呀？\n这盒巧克力是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:802cec06e6dbca2401f1628861e5faf8a92eb96634b6caae592ced5eabdbdb7d",
      "text": "这不是我之前提过\n想尝一次的那款吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5f597fd52afb0b1d290814b0fea642bc08c7e71e0652f565ab0c95b9289b1c0",
      "text": "要买到它想必非常不容易吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000030:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9cc0c6f8b0c91f2bbc2079809af1c7842c554a7e4cfd8526578a1eee874a0b34",
      "text": "听说很稀有，所以就努力去买了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c90b904804296758148658d498c77d237abdd8070c659a5e5dab8a02cc88ebfe",
      "text": "为了能让你高兴才特意挑选的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ae44b83d61b49da9b4e28a8f2ef3c2eebcdcb4c51afb62fe2b9fb645ecfaf23",
      "text": "那可真是……非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7ae44b83d61b49da9b4e28a8f2ef3c2eebcdcb4c51afb62fe2b9fb645ecfaf23",
      "text": "那可真是……非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b5dd1646b9bd698dbf474598d257de6b0a9f39a340d5ea1a8e14f9c97202c0b",
      "text": "在百忙之中为我准备的这份巧克力，\n我会怀着珍视的心情品尝的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:307b61928e738e4c8e23bca929e261ff908115fe9269a39e66744cf55b94a686",
      "text": "到了白色情人节，我也必须准备一份\n足以回应●●●●プロデューサー心意的回礼才行。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_028_22:5_01_028_22_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37da8b6f0b51a220fdd11dad314308b4490b29ec185bfc4f22a00da316d32e12",
      "text": "呵呵，看来我也得加把劲了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
